    "public_meaning": "Each benchmark is placed at the date of its associated paper or official announcement, as the source states it: mostly the first arXiv submission (v1) of the paper; PAW by its official announcement; OpenEQA by the year of its CVPR 2024 publication (day not established). This need not be the benchmark's first public appearance (BEHAVIOR-1K had an earlier CoRL 2022 / PMLR 2023 paper), and it is never the date of a leaderboard result or of the current protocol version."
